

                          V2.x Update Information
                          -----------------------


If you are a registered user of 4D-BBS V1.65 or below, and wish to
upgrade to V2.x, you need to either:


A) Send 7$ for a softbound manual, registered disk (with personal
   keyfile), and shipping.


B) Send a SASE with a disk, for the new version (with personal
   keyfile) and a text copy of the manual.


It is strongly recommended you go with option A, as the text manual
including in option B is a rough form of the final manual.


CornerStone can also be reached on internet.  Send all questions about
4D-BBS to 4d-bbs@crnstn.spk.wa.us.

